sequenceDiagram
  participant S as Scheduler
  participant L as Named Lifecycle Profile
  participant R as Receiver
  participant O as Observer
  S->>R: first valid delivery
  R-->>S: 204 after durable commit
  S->>L: restart argv (no shell)
  L-->>S: bounded process result
  loop readiness until deadline
    S->>O: health
    O-->>S: pending/ready
  end
  S->>R: duplicate same logical event
  R-->>S: 204
  S->>O: processing_count
  O-->>S: 1
